    "detailed_description": "Morphscape is a classic prop hunt game with many different twists and unique features where Hunters try to find and eliminate the Morphers before time runs out. Matches can accommodate up to twelve players, offering multiple customizable match settings for players to choose from.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619990/extras/ffd01a8bfa545f88606db16147bf26eb.avif?t=1714347770\" width=618 height=124 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Trying to hide the best they can and avoid being eliminated by the Hunters.<br></li><li>Two special abilities: Taunt and invisibility.<br></li><li>Two powerups: Health Boost and Speed Boost.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619990/extras/c88380f71eb8422803d0a1f77e0cc46a.avif?t=1714347770\" width=618 height=124 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hunters have to find and eliminate all the Morphers before the timer runs out.<br></li><li>Three weapons: Pistol, Rifle, Rocket Launcher.</li></ul>",
